WEBVTT

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:23.640
Can you hear me, everyone around 
the world who just tuned in?

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.380
I am speaking directly to your heart.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:31.230
This is not a malicious video

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:33.630
that will demand payment after viewing,

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:36.640
nor will it extract your 
personal information

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:41.140
or upload viruses to your computer.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:46.150
This is truly sacred like nothing else...

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:48.150
<b>"Special Love Ritual"</b>

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:53.740
Yes! This is a touching 
documentary of love and bonding!

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:57.030
Behold! Their bond is 
about to reach its climaxー

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:04.620
And so the thirteenth 
Star Child was born.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:11.920
She was just born, but she's already 
 the center of attention.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:17.360
Yeah, but isn't she a little bit different 
from the other Star Children?

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:19.950
Actually, she's clearly different.

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:22.170
Hey, Alfie, is she...

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:23.710
Alfie?!

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:24.930
What's wrong?

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:28.680
Looks like she's a little tired.

00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:32.190
She'll be fine, so keep 
getting to know each other.

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:34.940
Yeah, communication is the 
first step to team work!

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:37.140
Okay!

00:01:40.130 --> 00:01:44.270
Unbelievable! How did you not notice 
 Alfie was in such bad shape?!

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:47.080
You don't care about her anymore 
now that you're done with her?

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:48.780
It's not like that!

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:55.370
Sentimental journey...

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:02.940
Sentimenー

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:08.170
My king,

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:10.790
the child is born.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:12.540
I see.

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:16.150
It is finally the time to reveal the truth.

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:18.250
Summon him here.

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:19.990
Yes, my lord.

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:56.280
I've told you so many times!

00:03:56.280 --> 00:04:00.460
It's important to follow up 
after you're done!

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:02.480
I understand that now.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:04.360
Is that right?

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:07.960
I'm no match for Mana-sensei, who's had 
hundreds of successful relationships.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:14.040
Still, I'm surprised there's something 
similar to Christmas in this world.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:16.760
Do you miss the world of Sola?

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:18.650
Just a little bit.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.330
Over there!

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.720
I'll stop by the used book store!

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:31.520
Master Pervert Baron's first editions 
might be waiting to be found!

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:33.440
Don't stay there for too long.

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:35.120
I'll be close by.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.980
I know!

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:40.280
What should I do?

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:47.720
<b>Idol Goods Shop</b>

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:44.110
Idol goods shop?

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:46.470
Maybe I'll find something 
that Alfie will like.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:51.120
Why do they have so many Sola idol goods?

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:52.470
Not only that...

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.370
Seeking

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.370
Love

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:56.250
Double-Sided Folder

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:56.250
One-Sided Folder

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:59.600
Excuse me, could you recommend something

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:02.090
for an 80s idol present?

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:03.990
<b>Idols4life</b>

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:03.990
You must be an enthusiast!

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:06.430
I think the Sweet Class of '82
 would be a good choice.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:08.240
I-I see...

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:09.840
Thanks for coming!

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:12.520
Say hi to your girlfriend for me!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:16.220
The employee strongly recommended it...

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:19.020
but I wonder if Alfie will really like it?

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:20.380
Itsuki!

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:23.100
Narcisstes?

00:05:23.100 --> 00:05:25.710
The king has something important to tell you.

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:27.370
Please come with me.

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:29.260
Something important?

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:30.810
Yahoo!

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:32.250
I've finally found it!

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:35.890
A first edition of Master Pervert Baron's 
legendary masterpiece!

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:37.900
I'll show Itsuki...

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:38.520
Huh?

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:40.880
Itsuki and Narcisstes...

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:42.400
Where are they going?

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.400
It's starting to snow.

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:56.040
I want you to keep what 
I'm about to tell you to yourself.

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:57.540
All right.

00:05:57.950 --> 00:05:59.520
As you already know,

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.670
sealing the thirteenth phantom

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:05.060
is the only way to reverse 
the chaos of the stars.

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:09.450
Yes, so I have to go to the thirteenth labyrinth,

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:12.600
and defeat the thirteenth phantom, right?

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:18.170
What is it?

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:21.360
Is there something I need to 
know about the thirteenth phantom?

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:26.860
You can't defeat the thirteenth phantom the way 
you did the previous Impurity Lords.

00:06:27.210 --> 00:06:30.990
What's so different about the thirteenth phantom?!

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:33.740
The thirteenth phantom is...

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.740
Itsuki!

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:38.590
This is the first edition of Master 
Pervert Baron's legendary masterpiece!

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:42.710
Its title is "The Thirteenth 
Reality!" I finally got it!

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:46.160
Darn, it's a word off.

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:48.720
Anyway, where's Itsuki?

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:53.510
According to the ancient documents, 
the thirteenth phantom cannot be defeated.

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:55.390
Can't be defeated?

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:58.180
Are you saying that I can't 
defeat the thirteenth phantom?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:03.400
However, a method of sealing 
the thirteenth phantom...

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.720
A certain ritual was 
recorded in the documents.

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:10.160
It is the Ritual of the Great Star Ward.

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:12.300
Ritual of the Great Star Ward?

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:16.330
Does that mean I should offer 
a Star Ward like before?

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:20.330
But where's the Star Ward 
of the thirteenth phantom?

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:22.250
Are you here?

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:24.170
Here?

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:27.560
Don't tell me he already went 
to find the thirteenth phantom!

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:30.400
Where did you go?

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:32.740
The only place left is... over there?

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:34.180
There he is!

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:38.180
The Great Star Ward is 
not just any Star Ward.

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:39.820
Say it two more times!

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:43.350
Sound natural!

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:47.860
The Great Star Ward refers to 
the Visitor with twelve emblems.

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:52.090
In other words, it is you.

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:58.830
Are you saying that, 
in order to seal the thirteenth phantom,

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:01.830
I have to be the sacrifice?

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.900
I'm... the sacrifice?

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:07.960
I-Is there any other way?

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:10.840
There...

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:11.960
...isn't.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:13.210
What?!

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:17.240
Itsuki has to become the sacrifice 
to seal the thirteenth phantom?!

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:23.980
Yay! I've achieved my goal of repeating 
important things thirteen times!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:33.300
Itsuki... is the sacrifice?

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:36.920
He'll be the sacrifice...

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:38.580
The sacrifice...

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:47.030
What should I do after hearing that?

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:48.400
What should I...

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:51.880
Itsuki! There you are!

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:54.360
Did you bring a girl over to the castle?

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:56.270
That castle is the king's castle!

00:08:56.270 --> 00:08:59.520
It's not a love hotel by 
a highway interchange!

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:01.880
You're a player as usual!

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:03.920
Hey, Mana...

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:06.620
Please leave me alone for now.

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:33.690
Everybody...

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:37.180
seems so happy...

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:40.180
They're having so much fun...

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:48.200
It's so beautiful, but...

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:53.260
I'm the only one who can protect this world.

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:59.340
Itsuki...

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:02.250
Itsuki is going to die?

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:05.380
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:08.380
<i>What exactly should I do?</i>

00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:11.100
Yay! Thank you, daddy!

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:13.480
I love you, daddy!

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:14.840
I love you, too.

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:20.090
Oh, I have to buy something for everyone.

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:22.190
N-No, Itsuki!

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:25.100
That's a death flag! Don't trigger death flags!

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:31.330
What a nice view!

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.290
Look over there!

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:35.200
This is a present for you.

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:37.310
Huh? Why?

00:11:37.310 --> 00:11:39.260
Well, it's Christmas.

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:42.730
Also, you've helped me with 
so many things over the years.

00:11:42.730 --> 00:11:44.650
Wow, I'm getting goosebumps!

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:47.000
Hey, it shouldn't be a surprise...

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:49.070
Never mind.

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:52.100
Huh? Is someone angry?

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.090
Am not.

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:56.110
Can I open it?

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:00.360
This is...

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:04.870
The one I gave you before 
is all worn out, so...

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:09.550
Yeah, that's the one.

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:11.250
It's all ragged.

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:13.530
The chain's about to break, too.

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:15.260
You'll lose it again.

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:17.880
I won't be able to help you find it anymore.

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:19.200
Found it!

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:20.940
I found it, Mahiru!

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:25.600
I-I like it the way it is!

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:27.470
I've been carrying it the whole time.

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:29.390
Only as a charm, of course!

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:31.180
Oh?

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:33.390
Then you don't need it?

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:35.900
I'll have this, too!

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:38.900
Thanks, Itsuki.

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:42.100
It's nothing.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:44.780
Hey, Mahiru.

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:47.930
I made you a promise, right?

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:51.340
That we'll be together like 
this even when we grow up.

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:54.040
Yeah, but that's just a childhood promiseー

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:56.790
I still feel the same way.

00:12:57.590 --> 00:13:00.360
No matter what, I'll be with you.

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:02.310
In your heart.

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:03.850
Itsuki?

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:06.960
Well, no matter what happens...

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:10.150
think of that as me.

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:11.060
The zombie?

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:15.320
I made it as a good luck 
charm so that you can

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:18.760
return to our world, even by yourself...

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:21.000
A talisman of sorts...

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:23.870
Geez, what are you saying?

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:25.570
We're going back together, right?

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:27.510
Mahiru...

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:30.380
Itsuki!

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:32.590
Yuge Itsuki!

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:33.280
Yes?

00:13:33.280 --> 00:13:35.680
Let's get back to Japan together!

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:36.110
Huh?

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:39.040
But before that, for me...

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.740
For me...

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:46.250
Is there nothing for me?!

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:59.400
Alfie is...

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.540
Not here.

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:07.190
How are you feeling?

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:10.200
I feel a lot better now.

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:13.770
I made this for you.

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:15.740
I hope it'll make you feel better.

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:18.210
Wow! It looks tasty!

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:23.820
And I'm feeling so energetic!

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:24.820
I'm glad.

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:28.280
Anyway, you've increased your collection.

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:32.200
Yes, it's my way of escaping reality.

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.760
Escaping reality?

00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:39.020
When I see these, 
I can forget about reality.

00:14:41.170 --> 00:14:42.750
Oh, right.

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:45.400
These are Christmas presents for you.

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:47.780
Really? What did you get?

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:50.430
I don't know if you'll like them.

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:50.030
Idol4life

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:53.910
This is Ire-neko?!

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.910
Name: Neko-kichi              Born: June 26, 1981

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.910
Permanent Residence: 
8-22 Oaza, Amberjack Town, Marlin City, Whale Prefecture

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.910
Address: 
Chuo District Behind a Tiny Theater, Tokyo

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.910
{BLUE}Void if petted

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.910
Driver 
License

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.910
License Conditions: Do not 
