 No catnip while driving

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:56.560
I didn't really get it,

00:14:56.560 --> 00:15:00.580
but the guy at the idol shop 
strongly recommended those.

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:04.620
It's a really rare item, and I've 
wanted it for the longest time!

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:07.720
Thank you so much, Itsuki-san!

00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:08.910
That's a relief.

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:11.400
How about another sip of the soup?

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:12.550
Sure!

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:18.040
Sorry for causing so much trouble.

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:21.040
No, I was wondering if 
your Love Ritual with me

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.560
is the reason you're not feeling well.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:24.440
Huh?

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:28.030
And it felt like the 
Star Child you bore

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:31.690
is a bit different compared 
to the other Star Children.

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:39.800
There's just nothing for me!

00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:45.880
Itsuki-san, everything has to do 
with what I'm about to tell you.

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:49.380
Alfie must be getting a present now, too!

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:51.790
What are they talking about?

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:52.880
I...

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:56.400
was born to a Visitor

00:15:56.400 --> 00:16:00.200
who came to this world and 
a maiden 30 years ago.

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:04.150
What? Alfie is the child of 
a Visitor and a maiden?!

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:09.450
But one day, the maiden who gave birth 
to me was killed by an Impurity.

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:14.910
They feared I would be targeted 
too, so they let me escape...

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:17.420
Saying that I was a special child...

00:16:18.400 --> 00:16:20.060
A special child?

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:22.160
Does that mean...

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:27.290
I'm a special Star Child, born 
with the power of the maidens.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:28.800
You are?!

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:32.910
What? Alfie is the child of 
a Visitor and a maiden?!

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:36.650
But she's so pretty for a Star Child.

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:40.430
I thought Star Children 
would remain children...

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:44.590
But I no longer have the 
powers of a Star Child.

00:16:44.590 --> 00:16:47.840
My immortality and strength 
as a warrior are both gone.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:51.480
Is it because you performed 
a Love Ritual with me?

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:54.220
No! Don't worry about it.

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:58.070
I've lost my powers,
 but I used to be a Star Child.

00:16:58.070 --> 00:17:02.910
That's why I'm prepared to do 
anything to defend you, a Visitor.

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:06.330
Even if I lose my life...

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:09.230
Tears aren't decorations.

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:10.300
Alfie?

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:15.770
The JPOP Best Top 10!

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:17.590
This week's number one is...

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:26.480
<b>This Week's Top Ten              Total Points</b>

