Naked Season by me, Alfie!

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:26.480
Fresh, fresh, heart beam!

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:29.360
<b>{TS}Top 10</b>

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:33.360
The I in idol...

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:36.520
is the I in "I love you!"

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:39.320
After all, Alfie is

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:40.720
thirty!

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:43.330
So...

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:46.750
When I see you like that...

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:50.210
I feel... good.

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:51.710
Yeah?

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:56.050
My fingers don't sink 
while using a paper piano!

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.180
Itsuki...

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:03.180
What is that? What's going on?

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:06.180
But you've gotta do it!

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:08.110
You've gotta do it!

00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:09.590
You've gotta do it!

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:12.710
Come on, you too, Itsuki!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:15.680
You've gotta do it...

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:17.450
You've gotta do it!

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:19.290
You've gotta do it!

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:21.200
You've gotta do it!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.970
You've gotta do it!

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:24.660
You've gotta do it!

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:34.590
<i>I never knew how strong 
Alfie's determination was...</i>

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:41.450
I've... gotta do it!

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:53.610
Itsuki... You've finally made up your mind...

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:59.360
No, I can't be crying...

00:18:59.690 --> 00:19:02.300
Even thought I didn't get anything.

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:05.120
He needs me more than ever!

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:10.000
Oh, you're back already?

00:19:10.390 --> 00:19:11.440
Welcome back.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:12.780
I've been waiting for you.

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:14.810
What now?

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:17.380
What's that look?

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:19.300
I've been waiting.

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:23.560
Here's your Christmas present.

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:26.590
What? Just a candy?

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:28.810
Y-You're treating me like I'm a child!

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:29.580
No,

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:32.400
I know that's not enough.

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:36.570
Let me confirm something first.

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:39.710
You're in the girl category, right?

00:19:39.710 --> 00:19:41.720
What? Of course!

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:44.160
What are you saying after all this timeー

00:19:46.340 --> 00:19:51.790
Mana, thank you for supporting 
me in so many ways.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.430
Um...

00:19:56.280 --> 00:20:02.180
You're not going to tell me 
to give birth to your child, are you?!

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.060
Yes.

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:09.000
Aren't I good enough... for you?

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:12.810
N-No, you are...

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:15.360
No, don't look!

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:16.810
I'm embarrassed!

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:20.670
No, you're cute, Mana.

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:23.920
Come now...

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:25.540
I'm moving your tail away.

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:27.620
I'm so embarrassed!

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:31.500
I'm also... feeling... good...

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:42.850
Is this...

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:46.840
the last time I'll see you asleep?

00:21:18.360 --> 00:21:20.940
Itsuki?

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:23.130
Don't tell me he's gone!

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:25.870
Itsuki! Don't go on your own!

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:29.050
We just spent the night together!

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:33.080
How many times did I tell you that 
it's important to follow up after you're done?

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:34.280
Oh, it's a nice day.

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:35.850
Good morning, Mana.

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:40.860
M-Morning, I-Ikkun.

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:45.580
Hey, Mana, I decided to go today.

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:48.060
Huh? Go where?

00:21:48.060 --> 00:21:50.990
To seal the thirteenth phantom.

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:53.490
I-I see.

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:57.500
All right, let's go!

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:00.000
<b>Are You Going to Tell Me That 
You Want Me to Have Your Child</b>

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:40.020
Give Birth to My Child!

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:39.080
Ba-bam!
